@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Cricket Auction Manager";
}
<section class="landing-hero"><div class="hero-grid"></div><div class="hero-orb hero-orb-one"></div><div class="hero-orb hero-orb-two"></div><div class="container position-relative hero-content"><div class="row align-items-center g-5"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="hero-badge"><span></span> Cricket auction operations, simplified</div><h1>Build your dream squad.<br /><em>Run every bid with confidence.</em></h1><p class="hero-lead">A professional command center for cricket player auctions—manage player pools, team purses, lot queues, and winning bids in one focused workspace.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4"><a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" asp-controller="Auctions" asp-action="Index">Open auction center <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" asp-controller="Auctions" asp-action="Live">View live console</a></div><div class="hero-trust"><span>✓ Budget controls</span><span>✓ Audit-ready bids</span><span>✓ SQLite powered</span></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="hero-console-card"><div class="console-card-top"><span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE AUCTION CONTROL <span class="top-label">POMS / 01</span></div><div class="hero-player"><div class="player-avatar">AK</div><div><span>ON THE BLOCK</span><strong>Arjun Sharma</strong><small>All-rounder · Rating 88</small></div></div><div class="hero-bid"><div><small>HIGHEST BID</small><strong>₹ 2,450,000</strong><span>Mumbai Mavericks</span></div><div class="bid-pulse">LIVE<br /><small>00:24</small></div></div><div class="hero-lots"><span>LOT QUEUE</span><div><b>12</b> pending lots</div><div><b>06</b> sold today</div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="container landing-stats"><div><strong>@ViewBag.PlayerCount</strong><span>Active players</span></div><div><strong>@ViewBag.TeamCount</strong><span>Registered teams</span></div><div><strong>@ViewBag.AuctionCount</strong><span>Auctions hosted</span></div><div><strong>₹@ViewBag.TotalBudgetText</strong><span>Total team budget</span></div></section>
<section class="container landing-section"><div class="section-intro text-center mx-auto"><span class="eyebrow">One workspace. Every decision.</span><h2>Designed for the moments<br />that decide the match.</h2><p>From the first player list to the final hammer, keep your auction operation clear, fast, and under control.</p></div><div class="row g-4 mt-2"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon blue">01</div><h3>Curate the pool</h3><p>Keep every player’s role, rating, style, and base price ready for the next lot.</p><a asp-controller="Players" asp-action="Index">Manage players <span>↗</span></a></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon purple">02</div><h3>Protect the purse</h3><p>Set team budgets and let auction rules guard every bid before it reaches the room.</p><a asp-controller="Teams" asp-action="Index">Manage teams <span>↗</span></a></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon orange">03</div><h3>Run the room</h3><p>Bring players to the block, capture the highest bid, and publish sold or unsold.</p><a asp-controller="Auctions" asp-action="Live">Open live console <span>↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="container landing-section pb-5"><div class="workflow-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow light">A simple operating rhythm</span><h2>From setup to sold.</h2><p>Keep your auction team aligned with a clear, repeatable workflow.</p></div><div class="workflow-steps"><div><b>01</b><span>Configure</span><small>Rules & teams</small></div><div><b>02</b><span>Shortlist</span><small>Build your lots</small></div><div><b>03</b><span>Bid</span><small>Run the room</small></div><div><b>04</b><span>Announce</span><small>Sell the player</small></div></div></div></section>
